{"chunkId": "d22d18fe-ebe8-52b0-bf1f-fea498781625", "text": "心理意象：在阅读学习材料时，在脑海中形成与内容相关的视觉图像，通过视觉编码来辅助记忆。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "7ef5eb92-1119-52d1-a7a0-76bc6f3177a9", "text": "心理意象的第 1 步：阅读描述性的学习材料。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "7eaa86a9-5439-545e-b8c5-0fe406523a22", "text": "心理意象的第 2 步：在脑海中形成与文字内容对应的视觉图像。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "23f722a0-e517-5b52-b5a3-7f05287d78f2", "text": "心理意象的第 3 步：想象图像中各元素之间的关系和互动。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "37bb5e8b-8f2f-5d55-b767-325b1e289470", "text": "心理意象的第 4 步：通过回忆心理图像来提取信息。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 4}}
{"chunkId": "9e1d5504-fdf3-5382-930a-f998331edc31", "text": "心理意象适合描述性文本和具体对象的学习，原因是：当材料描述具体的物体、场景或过程时，心理意象能有效辅助记忆。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "描述性文本和具体对象的学习"}}
{"chunkId": "4c242011-26b9-5960-b003-84b28086580c", "text": "心理意象适合听觉通道接收信息时，原因是：当学习者通过听而非读的方式接收信息时，心理意象的效果可能更明显。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "听觉通道接收信息时"}}
{"chunkId": "d5f55778-bfdc-526e-b6c3-d5f3a87f6a42", "text": "心理意象不适合抽象概念的学习，原因是：抽象概念难以形成具体的视觉图像，心理意象的效果有限。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "抽象概念的学习"}}
{"chunkId": "ccd7abb6-02a5-58ba-af55-cf451a89d119", "text": "心理意象不适合需要详细理解文本含义的任务，原因是：标准化测试（如大都会成就测验）中，心理意象训练未显示出对理解力的提升效果。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-imagery", "strategyName": "心理意象", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.3, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.3, "overallScore": 0.37, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要详细理解文本含义的任务"}}
